Package: cudaverse
Title: GPU-Aware Numerical Computing for R
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides one coherent interface for experimental GPU-aware
    numerical computing in R. Includes dense tensors, sparse matrices,
    decompositions, distances, nearest neighbours, clustering, graph
    workflows, and embeddings. Includes a lightweight native CUDA backend that
    discovers NVIDIA runtime libraries lazily, plus portable R and optional
    'torch' backends for development, testing, and reproducible fallback
    behavior.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://cudaverse.github.io/cudaverse/,
    https://github.com/cudaverse/cudaverse
BugReports: https://github.com/cudaverse/cudaverse/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    Matrix,
    methods,
    stats
