    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    torch,
    uwot
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
SystemRequirements: Optional NVIDIA CUDA driver, NVIDIA cuBLAS 12, and NVIDIA
    cuSOLVER 11 at runtime for native GPU execution
NeedsCompilation: yes
